style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8884em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\"><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7253em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3912em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为投资支出，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为运维成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为燃料成本（光伏为 0），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 年发电量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 为折现率。</p>\n<p>2025年中国典型集中式光伏 LCOE 已降至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.15</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>0.25</mn><mtext> CNY/kWh</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.15\\sim 0.25\\ \\text{CNY/kWh}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.15</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CNY/kWh</span></span></span></span></span></span>，低于多数新建煤电。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程应用\">工程应用</h2><h3 id=\"分布式光伏系统设计\">分布式光伏系统设计</h3><p>某工商业屋顶 5 MW 项目设计要点：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>资源评估</strong>：利用 NASA POWER 或中国气象数据获取水平面辐照量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">GHI</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>，倾斜面辐照量通过 Perez 模型转换</li>\n<li><strong>组件选型</strong>：选用 182mm TOPCon 双面组件，功率 580 Wp，温度系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-0.30\\%/°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.30%/°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>逆变器配置</strong>：组串式逆变器，每串 26 块组件（考虑最低温度下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{oc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不超过 1500V 系统电压）</li>\n<li><strong>发电量模拟</strong>：使用 PVsyst 软件，考虑遮挡、灰尘、线损、逆变器效率、组件衰减等因素</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"跟踪系统经济性分析\">跟踪系统经济性分析</h3><p>单轴跟踪 vs. 固定倾角对比（以中国西部 I 类资源区为例）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>固定倾角</th>\n<th>单轴跟踪</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首年利用小时数</td>\n<td>1650 h</td>\n<td>2050 h</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统成本增加</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>+8–12%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25年发电量增加</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>+18–25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LCOE 下降</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>-8–15%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在土地成本较低的地区，单轴跟踪已成为标配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>晶硅占据光伏市场 95% 以上份额，技术主线从 PERC（23.5–24.5%）演进到 TOPCon（25–26%）、HJT（25.5–26.5%）与背接触（BC）路线，竞争焦点始终是钝化质量与成本。</li>\n<li>钙钛矿是效率提升最快的材料（单结 26.7%、钙钛矿/硅叠层 33.9%），带隙可调使其天然适合叠层，但长期稳定性、大面积均匀性与铅毒性仍是产业化瓶颈。</li>\n<li>组件级设计（串联匹配、半片、旁路二极管、封装可靠性）与系统级设计（MPPT 算法、容配比、阵列间距、PR）共同决定电站实际收益。</li>\n<li>MPPT 要在局部遮挡造成的多峰 P-V 曲线上寻找全局最优；LCOE 则是评估技术路线的统一经济指标——2025 年中国集中式光伏 LCOE（0.15–0.25 CNY/kWh）已低于多数新建煤电。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"思考与拓展\">思考与拓展</h2><ol>\n<li>TOPCon 电池的隧穿氧化层厚度为什么必须精确控制在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.2</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>1.8</mn><mtext> nm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.2\\sim 1.8\\ \\text{nm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.8</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nm</span></span></span></span></span></span>？过薄和过厚分别会导致什么问题？</li>\n<li>在高纬度地区（如北欧），双面组件 + 白色地面反射增益比低纬度地区更显著的物理原因是什么？</li>\n<li>分析：为什么 2024 年后钙钛矿/硅叠层电池被认为是最有可能大规模量产的&quot;超高效&quot;路线？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"参考资料\">参考资料</h2><ul>\n<li>Luque, A. &amp; Hegedus, S., <em>Handbook of Photovoltaic Science and Engineering</em>, 2nd Ed., Wiley, 2011</li>\n<li>Green, M.A. et al., &quot;Solar Cell Efficiency Tables (Version 64)&quot;, <em>Progress in Photovoltaics</em>, 2024</li>\n<li>IEC 61215:2021, <em>Terrestrial photovoltaic (PV) modules — Design qualification and type approval</em></li>\n<li>中国光伏行业协会，《中国光伏产业发展路线图（2024版）》</li>\n<li>PVsyst SA, <em>PVsyst 8 User Manual</em>, 2024</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"光伏技术与系统","id":"光伏技术与系统"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"晶体硅光伏技术","id":"晶体硅光伏技术"},{"level":3,"text":"薄膜光伏技术","id":"薄膜光伏技术"},{"level":3,"text":"钙钛矿太阳能电池","id":"钙钛矿太阳能电池"},{"level":3,"text":"光伏组件设计","id":"光伏组件设计"},{"level":3,"text":"最大功率点追踪（MPPT）","id":"最大功率点追踪-mppt"},{"level":3,"text":"光伏电站规划","id":"光伏电站规划"},{"level":3,"text":"度电成本（LCOE）","id":"度电成本-lcoe"},{"level":2,"text":"工程应用","id":"工程应用"},{"level":3,"text":"分布式光伏系统设计","id":"分布式光伏系统设计"},{"level":3,"text":"跟踪系统经济性分析","id":"跟踪系统经济性分析"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"思考与拓展","id":"思考与拓展"},{"level":2,"text":"参考资料","id":"参考资料"}],"prev":{"title":"半导体物理与光电转换","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/energy-science/energy-conversion-fundamentals/semiconductor-photovoltaics"},"next":{"title":"风力发电工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/energy-science/solar-and-wind-energy/wind-power-engineering"}}